		"client/src/App.js-simstep-aaa1772b-f2c4-496f-be72-6bba3b8e4988": {
			"path": "client/src/App.js-simstep-aaa1772b-f2c4-496f-be72-6bba3b8e4988",
			"fileName": "App.js",
			"wiki": "A user navigates to a URL with a specific room ID, such as '/room/tech-talk-123'. The React Router in the client application matches this path and renders the `Room` component.",
			"cellName": "Route Matching - App.js:L11",
			"cellId": "8921f583-7985-482d-aa81-532c0ed7ec24",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 11,
			"endLine": 11,
			"parentCellId": "adc00225-341a-4a9f-b4a3-4a752ed4895f",
			"parentPath": "client/src/App.js"
		},
		"dba46854-9aa9-4608-b8f2-ff4b1949b816": {
			"path": "dba46854-9aa9-4608-b8f2-ff4b1949b816",
			"cellName": "Client Initiates Connection - Room.js:L143-147",
			"cellId": "dba46854-9aa9-4608-b8f2-ff4b1949b816",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "a6113d06-f109-4f42-8ddc-8a02175540ce"
		},
		"client/src/routes/Room.js-simstep-acae6d4c-c22c-4669-92b8-2d810b43bc14": {
			"path": "client/src/routes/Room.js-simstep-acae6d4c-c22c-4669-92b8-2d810b43bc14",
			"fileName": "Room.js",
			"wiki": "The `Room` component mounts and its `useEffect` hook is executed. It establishes a connection to the Socket.IO server, captures the user's camera and microphone, and emits a `join-room` event containing the room ID and randomly generated initial coordinates.",
			"cellName": "Client Initiates Connection - Room.js:L143-147",
			"cellId": "dba46854-9aa9-4608-b8f2-ff4b1949b816",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 143,
			"endLine": 147,
			"parentCellId": "a6113d06-f109-4f42-8ddc-8a02175540ce",
			"parentPath": "client/src/routes/Room.js"
		},
		"6a1d6490-ca18-446a-9eea-5a30cbde051e": {
			"path": "6a1d6490-ca18-446a-9eea-5a30cbde051e",
			"cellName": "Server Handles New User and Gets Room Roster - server.js:L13-31",
			"cellId": "6a1d6490-ca18-446a-9eea-5a30cbde051e",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "5bb9d807-3e54-44ac-bf11-b267785ea0f8"
		},
		"server.js-simstep-764a43e0-1ba7-45f9-b907-da999ab80f71": {
			"path": "server.js-simstep-764a43e0-1ba7-45f9-b907-da999ab80f71",
			"fileName": "server.js",
			"wiki": "The server's `connection` handler receives the `join-room` event. It creates a `newPeer` object for the new user, adds them to the in-memory `users` store for the specified room, and then filters the store to get a list of all other users already present.",
			"cellName": "Server Handles New User and Gets Room Roster - server.js:L13-31",
			"cellId": "6a1d6490-ca18-446a-9eea-5a30cbde051e",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 13,
			"endLine": 31,
			"parentCellId": "5bb9d807-3e54-44ac-bf11-b267785ea0f8",
			"parentPath": "server.js"
		},
		"c25511fb-d13d-4eeb-a90a-88cc9df2f369": {
			"path": "c25511fb-d13d-4eeb-a90a-88cc9df2f369",
			"cellName": "Client Creates Peer Connections - Room.js:L156-161",
			"cellId": "c25511fb-d13d-4eeb-a90a-88cc9df2f369",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "a6113d06-f109-4f42-8ddc-8a02175540ce"
		},
		"client/src/routes/Room.js-simstep-270b5313-ffca-4afe-a871-9656691087ea": {
			"path": "client/src/routes/Room.js-simstep-270b5313-ffca-4afe-a871-9656691087ea",
			"fileName": "Room.js",
			"wiki": "The new client's listener for the `existing-users` event fires. It iterates through the received list of users and calls the `createMyPeer` function for each one to initiate a WebRTC peer-to-peer connection.",
			"cellName": "Client Creates Peer Connections - Room.js:L156-161",
			"cellId": "c25511fb-d13d-4eeb-a90a-88cc9df2f369",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 156,
			"endLine": 161,
			"parentCellId": "a6113d06-f109-4f42-8ddc-8a02175540ce",
			"parentPath": "client/src/routes/Room.js"
		},
		"cc6c977b-b66f-4794-baa1-d21ccbddbb5f": {
			"path": "cc6c977b-b66f-4794-baa1-d21ccbddbb5f",
			"cellName": "Server Relays WebRTC Signal - server.js:L36-41",
			"cellId": "cc6c977b-b66f-4794-baa1-d21ccbddbb5f",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "5bb9d807-3e54-44ac-bf11-b267785ea0f8"
		},
		"server.js-simstep-4300f1bc-e238-46c7-a2d7-02a713b13809": {
			"path": "server.js-simstep-4300f1bc-e238-46c7-a2d7-02a713b13809",
			"fileName": "server.js",
			"wiki": "The server acts as a signaling intermediary. It receives the `stream-to-existing-users` event from the new user and forwards the signal payload to the intended recipient (the existing user) by emitting a `user-joined` event.",
			"cellName": "Server Relays WebRTC Signal - server.js:L36-41",
			"cellId": "cc6c977b-b66f-4794-baa1-d21ccbddbb5f",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 36,
